graph TD
    START((User)) --> IMPORT{Import CSV?}

    IMPORT -->|Yes| CSV[Upload CSV File]
    CSV --> PARSE[Parse & Create CardRows]
    PARSE --> INSERT[Insert UserCollectionRows]
    INSERT --> AUTO[Auto-schedule background canonize]
    AUTO --> BULK

    IMPORT -->|No, existing cards| CLICK[Click 'Canonize All' button]
    CLICK --> BULK

    subgraph BULK[Bulk Canonize Process]
        QUERY[Query unlinked entries]
        QUERY --> LOOP{More entries?}
        LOOP -->|Yes| SEARCH[Search MYP by name]
        SEARCH --> MATCH{Match found?}
        MATCH -->|Yes| LINK[Create CardRow + SourceCardRow]
        LINK --> PRICE[Fetch current price]
        PRICE --> UPDATE[Link entry to card_id]
        UPDATE --> LOOP
        MATCH -->|No| SKIP[Skip / log error]
        SKIP --> LOOP
        LOOP -->|No| DONE[Return summary]
    end

    DONE --> RESULT[Show result banner]
    RESULT --> REFRESH[Refresh collection data]
    REFRESH --> END((Collection updated))

    CLI_START((Admin)) --> DRY{Dry run?}
    DRY -->|Yes| COUNT[Show unlinked count]
    COUNT --> CLI_END((Done))
    DRY -->|No| BULK
